  "body": "Now $1,499,000 | CV $2,375,000\r\n\r\nImagine telling your friends you bought sea views, 7th back from the beachfront reserve, a legal income flat and a Rangitoto-zoned home for $876,000 under CV. You won’t see a deal like this often, and the buyer who moves first wins\r\n\r\n• Council records show 300m2 home on 613m² freehold land (more or less)\r\n• Sea views down to Rothesay Bay Beach\r\n• 3 bedrooms upstairs, including a master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Legal 1-bedroom income flat with its own entrance\r\n• Double garage and off-street parking\r\n• Zoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay & Northcross Intermediates and Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nThis home will be sold within the next three weeks.\r\nWe’re looking for a serious, qualified buyer with finance in place who is ready to sign. The full building report is available now, so you can do your checks upfront.\r\n\r\nIf you’re a serious buyer, call Bob or Becky today",
